    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Stunning one bedroom first floor open plan apartment overlooking Bram Stoker Park\r\n\r\nThis excellent apartment features a welcoming entrance hall with stylish flooring and a convenient hot press. To the left of the hallway is a spacious, light-filled double bedroom with laminate flooring and generous storage space. The property also includes a partially tiled bathroom with a walk-in shower, convenient built-in storage, and well-maintained sanitary ware. The accommodation is completed by a stunning open-plan living, dining, and kitchen area. The recently refurbished kitchen offers a bright and inviting space with ample cupboard and countertop space, making it ideal for both everyday living and entertaining. This superb property also benefits from a designated car parking space.\r\n\r\nLocated close to Fairview, Clontarf, and Killester Villages, this apartment is surrounded by cafés, restaurants, bars and boutiques. Transport is excellent, with bus routes along Clontarf and Howth Roads and Clontarf Road DART station under 3 minutes away. East Point Business Park, the IFSC, and Dublin City Centre are all easily accessible."
      },
      {
